+// VALIDATION §3.3. bands_f32 layout: for component c in [0, 3), level l in [0, 5), band b in [0, 4),
+// row-major float32 with dimensions (aligned_extent >> (l + 1)) and no padding between bands.
+// aligned_extent = max(align_up(size, 32), 128). count is the sum of those texel counts.
+// Levels 0 and 1 are stored as R16F, round-to-nearest-even. Levels 2..4 are stored as R32F.
+// Runs quant through block packing with quant scale -1 and advances the sequence counter
+// the same way pyrowave_encoder_encode_cpu does. A command buffer must not be set on the device.
+PYROWAVE_PUBLIC_API pyrowave_result
+pyrowave_encoder_encode_bands(pyrowave_encoder encoder, const float *bands_f32, size_t count,
+                              const pyrowave_rate_control *rate_control);
